| **Layer (Top → Bottom)**              | **Main Function**                                           | **Examples / Protocols**   | **Related OSI Layers**             |
| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| **Application Layer**                 | Supports network applications & support  to users or        | HTTP, SMTP, DNS, FTP       | Application, Presentation, Session |
| **Transport Layer**                   | Process-to-process data transfer; ensures reliable delivery | TCP, UDP                   | Transport                          |
| **Network Layer (Internet Layer)**    | Routing of data (choosing best path)                        | IP (IPv4, IPv6), ICMP, ARP | Network                            |
| **Link Layer (Network Access Layer)** | Data transfer between neighboring network devices           | Ethernet, Wi-Fi, PPP       | Data Link + Physical               |
